 ## Pointer Effects (UI Component)
 UPointerEffectsComponent ("Pointer Effects") on any widget. Preset (quick starts named by trigger) TiltCard "Tilt Card Hover" (default), HolographicCard "Holographic Card Hover", ShimmerButton "Shimmer Hover", MagneticButton "Magnetic Hover", Ripple "Ripple Click", Custom. PresetAsset (UPointerEffectsPresetAsset "Pointer Effects Preset": Tilt, Magnet, Press, Lights, Ripple, Overlays; Save As Preset, Apply Preset Asset, Copy To Preset Asset). Intensity. ActiveWhen (condition over everything). Tilt (bEnabled, ShowWhen, MaxAngle, Direction PressAway / RiseToward, Perspective, HoverScale, Spring). Magnet (ShowWhen, Pull, MaxOffset, Range, Spring). Press (ShowWhen, PressScale, Spring). Lights (list of FPointerLight: Kind Spotlight / Sheen (SheenAngle, SheenWidth) / BorderGlow (BorderWidth) / Holographic; Show WhileHovered / NearPointer / Always; ShowWhen; Color alpha = strength; Radius). Ripple (ShowWhen, Color, Duration). Overlays (FPointerOverlay: ShowWhen, Image = texture / material / SVG (FWidgetEffectImage with MaterialParameters), Placement Fill / FollowPointer (Size, cut to the widget) / FollowPointerUncut, Tint, bBehindContent) - materials get Pointer (U, V, hover, pressed), PointerHover, PointerVelocity (x, y, speed, proximity), PointerProximity, PointerPressed, EffectStrength, WidgetSize every frame. ShowWhen (FPointerEffectCondition): Trigger Default / Always / WhileHovered / NearPointer / WhilePressed / WhileFocused / ConditionOnly + Condition name (+ bInvertCondition); conditions come from Set Effect Condition(name, bool) / Clear Effect Condition, the widget or its User Widget implementing the Pointer Effects Condition interface (GetPointerEffectCondition(name, out met) -> answers), or built-ins On / Off (Context Menu Button toggle) and Usable / Disabled. bMatchWidgetCorners or CornerRadius. ProximityRange, HoverFade, bReactToFocus (keyboard/gamepad navigation focus = hover; a click's focus doesn't), bReactWhileDisabled (off: disabled widgets lie still), Set Virtual Pointer (stick). Outputs: bDriveMaterials (material parameters Pointer = (U, V, hover, pressed), PointerHover, PointerVelocity = (x, y, speed, proximity) on Image / Border / shape materials, bIncludeChildren), bDriveShapeGradients (radial gradient center follows the pointer), AnimationPointerValue / AnimationHoverValue (Widget Animation values), MachinePointerInput / MachineHoverInput / MachineProximityInput (state machine inputs). Event On Pointer Effects Updated; Get Pointer State. bPreviewInDesigner + DesignerPointer + bPreviewConditionsAsMet. PointerSource Pointer / Widget + PointerWidget (the pointer read as another widget's middle - a Constraint Target keyed on its Transform track sweeps the effects; Set Pointer Source Widget). Set / Clear / Get Animated Input (PointerX, PointerY 0..1 across the widget, Hover 0..1, Press >0.5 = pressed, rising past 0.5 = click + ripple). Widget Animation track "Pointer Effects": Animates Setting (Channel Intensity, TiltAngle, MagnetPull, LightStrength) / PointerX / PointerY / Hover / Press; a new track sweeps Pointer X 0 -> 1. Value input "Pointer Distance and Motion" (Distance, Proximity, Direction, Speed, VelocityX/Y) on any value track.
